 cross-entropy loss on soft labels. Use OneCycleLR scheduler with peak lr=5e-4 and warmup ratio=0.1. Keep early stopping patience=10, 50 total epochs, batch size 128, gradient clipping max_norm=1.0, label smoothing 0.1, AdamW optimizer with weight_decay=1e-4. This integrates the initial plan's gradual unfreezing and mixup, while being informed by the overfitting patterns observed in the current run."}, "parse_success": true, "raw_response": "{
